description:
Run any RedBison calculator by id with named inputs and get the result as JSON: mortgages and loans, savings and investing, pay and tax, body and fitness, maths, statistics, geometry, construction, science and engineering (beams, bolts, wire size, PCB traces, pipe flow, rafters, sheet metal and more). Call list_calculators first to see ids, inputs and units.

Returns: JSON { id, title, url, inputs, result } with the calculator's outputs.
Example input: {"id":"percentage-calculator","inputs":{}}
